/-- If a linear map `A` vanishes on `Tᗮ`, then the adjoint of `A` takes values in `T`. -/
theorem adjoint_apply_mem_of_forall_mem_orthogonal {A : E →ₗ[𝕜] F} {T : Submodule 𝕜 E}
