modulus of `A P` is `|A| P`. -/
theorem operatorAbs_comp_of_commute {A : E →ₗ[𝕜] F} {P : E →ₗ[𝕜] E}
    (hP : P.IsSymmetricProjection) (h : Commute P (A.adjoint ∘ₗ A)) :
